<title>NEW ZEALAND: Tranz Rail Q3 net profit NZ$20.6 mln.</title>
<headline>Tranz Rail Q3 net profit NZ$20.6 mln.</headline>
<dateline>WELLINGTON 1997-05-01</dateline>
<text>
<p>Quarter ended March 31.</p>
<p>			   (million NZ$ unless stated)</p>
<p>    Net profit				  20.6 vs 14.4</p>
<p>    Shr (cents)			   16.0 vs 15.0</p>
<p>    Turnover			     150.3 vs 150.3</p>
<p>    Operating profit		    31.1 vs 29.7</p>
<p>    Shares outstanding (million)   127.3 vs 95.3</p>
<p>----------Nine months ended March 31---------</p>
<p>    Net profit			    44.7 vs 33.3</p>
<p>    Shr (cents)			   35.0 vs 35.0</p>
<p>    Turnover			     435.1 vs 430.9</p>
<p>    Operating profit		    77.7 vs 76.1</p>
<p>    Shares outstanding (million)   127.1 vs 95.2</p>
<p>Note - Tranz Rail Holdings Ltd is New Zealand's railways operator.</p>
<p>--Wellington Newsroom (64 4) 4734746</p>
</text>
